OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid would not reverse Covid
OL,4,Ainquiry promise, Welsh minister told
OL,5,Acampaigner
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Welsh minister reassured the bereaved
OL,8,Fdaughter of a Covid-19 victim that
OL,9,FPlaid Cymru would not roll back on a
OL,10,Fcommitment to hold a pandemic inquiry
OL,11,Ftwo months before her party entered
OL,12,Fgovernment.
OL,14,FIn a private message seen by BBC Wales,
OL,15,FHeledd Fychan told the campaigner that
OL,16,Fshe had "communicated badly" in an
OL,17,Finterview in which she had said there
OL,18,Fwould be an investigation instead of a
OL,19,Ffull inquiry.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
