OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid would not reverse Covid
OL,4,Ainquiry promise, Welsh minister told
OL,5,Acampaigner
OL,6,
OL,7,FWelsh culture minister Fychan sent the
OL,8,Fmessage while she was an opposition
OL,9,FSenedd member to Sam Smith-Higgins,
OL,10,Fco-chair of Covid-19 Bereaved Families
OL,11,Ffor Justice Cymru, in March.
OL,13,FFirst minister and Plaid leader Rhun ap
OL,14,FIorwerth said that there had been no
OL,15,Fattempt to mislead anyone.
